# Internal process packs and their qualification evidence.
# These are working material for a single machine: they carry local paths,
# candidate SHAs and internal review records, and this repository is public.
MARSHAL_PROCESS_*/
MARSHAL_TUI_ULTIMATE_SPEC/
MARSHAL-*-MEGA-TASK/

# Task specification packs. These are working documents handed to an agent, not
# part of MARSHAL, and some of them name the production host, its paths and its
# admin ports. Ignoring them here means a `git add -A` cannot sweep that into a
# public repository by accident — which it very nearly did.
MARSHAL_COMMUNITY_CLOUD_ULTRA_ACTIVATION_TELEMETRY_FINAL_MEGA_ULTRA_V2/
